      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of meaninglessness, and that feeling of being a cog in a machine is incredibly heavy. When everything feels routine and empty, it's easy to start questioning the value of your own existence. If you're feeling this hollow, perhaps it's time to explore what would make the \"system\" feel less like a machine and more like something you actually inhabit.",
